[{:adr/authoritative_for ["kotoba-lang repos still authored in TypeScript after the etzhayyim-sdk relocation (ipfs, atproto-client, base-l2, checkpointer, witness-quorum, pqh, kami-nv-compat, kotodama-host->kototama) are ported to pure .cljc with an injected-capability seam and the TypeScript deleted" "the porting recipe: pure .cljc core (records/protocol/data, zero vendor SDK, zero network I/O) + defprotocol capability seam + host-injected reify impls; koe ports.cljc is the template, ed25519 deps.edn/nbb.edn the scaffold" "TS disposition: delete TS entirely (host injects the vendor capability) — owner-confirmed 2026-07-01" "landing: child-repo worktree -> lint+test -> server-side merge -> advance superproject west pin via GitHub-API single-entry; no --force, no rewrite" "out of scope: svgraph, kotoba-v2025 (76MB Rust), kotodama-mcp/-py/-cells/-holochain (deferred)" "2026-07-02: all 8 repos have landed at least one pass. A follow-up audit found base-l2/pqh/checkpointer had real .clj-vs-.cljc gaps (TS deleted but files never made genuinely dual-platform) despite being marked done -- fixed; witness-quorum audited and correctly confirmed intentional .clj-only (documented per-file + README + genuine JVM-concurrency/sibling-dep blockers). kami-nv-compat (Step 7) landed complete via its own ADR-2607020130. kotodama-host (Step 8) is now COMPLETE via its own ADR-2607022900: the 'merge into kototama' framing was retired as inaccurate shorthand (kotodama-host's own originating ADR-2607010000 always specified a standalone Wasm component host, which is what shipped; kototama is an unrelated Wasm unikernel tender per ADR-2607022400). This umbrella ADR's full scope is now closed -- all 8 repos done, no open plan conflicts."], :adr/incident "{:id \"manifest-clobber-260701\", :summary \"PR #222 (a77ad65fb93) clobbered manifest/repos.edn + manifest/west.yml + ADR-2607011100 with 0-line scratchpad pointers; main manifest toolchain broken; repaired by concurrent session 5b3be53b5ef0 + PR #226\", :last_good_manifest_commit \"f447108913f\", :resolved_by \"5b3be53b5ef0 (concurrent session 'repair repos.edn corrupted by a bad API PUT') + PR #226\", :lesson \"squash-merge can land a botched working tree; run gen-west-manifest --check in CI before merge\"}", :adr/topic "kotoba-lang", :adr/related ["ADR-2606302300 (org taxonomy; kotoba-lang layer test §Step-1)" "ADR-2606290000 (all-workers-CLJC-only policy)" "ADR-2607010930 (clj-wgsl Rust->Clojure migration; substrate boundary)" "ADR-2607011830 / 2607011930 / 2607011940 (etzhayyim-sdk relocation of these repos)" "ADR-2606302300 / 2607011100 (SVG-era office repo split — the #222 clobber incident)" "ADR-2607020130 (Step 7, kami-nv-compat CLJC port, own ADR)" "ADR-2607022900 (Step 8, kotodama-host standalone :component-host, own ADR, closes this umbrella ADR's last open item)"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607012200-kotoba-lang-cljc-refactor", :adr/scope_repos "{:done [\"orgs/kotoba-lang/ipfs\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/atproto-client\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/base-l2\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/witness-quorum\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/pqh\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/checkpointer\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/kami-nv-compat\" \"orgs/kotoba-lang/kotodama-host\"], :pending [], :phased []}", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-02", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/reuse ["orgs/kotoba-lang/ed25519" "orgs/kotoba-lang/cacao" "orgs/kotoba-lang/did" "orgs/kotoba-lang/dag-cbor" "orgs/kotoba-lang/multiformats" "orgs/kotoba-lang/eth-crypto" "orgs/kotoba-lang/koe (ports.cljc injected-capability template)"], :adr/title "ADR-2607012200: kotoba-lang TypeScript -> portable CLJC refactor (pure core + injected-capability seam; delete TS)"}]